WEBVTT

01:47.300 --> 01:51.940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:52.060 --> 01:54.980
[Episode 14]
[This story is purely fictional]

03:33.960 --> 03:35.610
Master, Tu is dead.

03:36.280 --> 03:37.450
You can take my Cui.

03:45.840 --> 03:46.570
Cui?

04:14.310 --> 04:14.890
Cui.

04:16.240 --> 04:21.850
♪The river in Guangling flows like an emerald ribbon♪

04:23.160 --> 04:29.250
♪The royal fleet sways to common woes♪

04:30.160 --> 04:32.460
♪Don't ask from whence I came♪

04:32.480 --> 04:33.660
You're in a good mood today.

04:35.000 --> 04:36.140
You're singing a Xiangxi song.

04:38.680 --> 04:40.140
We live to see another day.

04:40.680 --> 04:42.850
And so I must sing joyfully.

04:45.390 --> 04:45.810
Master Zhang,

04:47.120 --> 04:48.140
to be honest with you,

04:48.800 --> 04:50.850
I thought we were done for.

04:51.360 --> 04:52.700
I performed a divination before I left,

04:53.000 --> 04:54.730
and I got death.

04:55.800 --> 04:56.980
You can die now.

04:58.430 --> 05:00.290
Or people might say that your divination

05:00.510 --> 05:01.170
never comes true.

05:02.430 --> 05:03.580
They won't.

05:04.390 --> 05:07.020
Because we ran into a Qiongqi.

05:07.480 --> 05:08.340
My ancestors told me

05:08.870 --> 05:10.930
that any divination involving a person

05:11.560 --> 05:13.900
with a Qiongqi tattoo would never be accurate.

05:14.390 --> 05:15.580
So you risked your life to come here.

05:16.270 --> 05:18.050
What did you find?

05:18.480 --> 05:19.100
Tell me.

05:19.600 --> 05:20.020
Master Zhang,

05:20.360 --> 05:21.340
that's not what I meant.

05:21.630 --> 05:22.370
I meant...

05:23.830 --> 05:24.490
Fine.

05:24.500 --> 05:25.290
I'll tell you.

05:26.040 --> 05:27.410
The ritual grass in the shrine

05:27.600 --> 05:28.580
is in the style of Xiangxi.

05:28.950 --> 05:31.020
In Xiangxi, the ritual grass is used in cave rituals.

05:31.160 --> 05:32.490
Only the one who receives enlightenment in the cave

05:32.870 --> 05:34.460
can take the ritual grass with them to preach.

05:35.160 --> 05:36.020
Not only does the Otherworld Patriarch

05:36.160 --> 05:37.410
has a tower in Changsha,

05:37.510 --> 05:38.900
but he also has a cave in Xiangxi.

05:39.830 --> 05:41.290
So Xiangxi it is, then.

05:41.920 --> 05:42.660
Master Zhang,

05:43.360 --> 05:44.370
I'm curious.

05:45.270 --> 05:46.810
How did you find me?

05:47.480 --> 05:48.220
I didn't leave

05:48.630 --> 05:50.290
any traces behind on my journey.

05:50.630 --> 05:51.980
Xiangu sent a messenger.

05:52.510 --> 05:54.050
Master Zhang, can we speak?

05:57.510 --> 05:58.660
Xiangu told me to come here.

05:59.270 --> 06:01.140
She said Eighth Master was in grave danger,

06:01.360 --> 06:02.980
and that you had to go to this place immediately.

06:08.750 --> 06:10.050
Xiangu was so kind.

06:10.950 --> 06:12.370
She sent Xiaomei to inform you.

06:13.560 --> 06:16.290
That means she does like you.

06:16.750 --> 06:17.660
She might not show

06:18.270 --> 06:19.610
the same kindness to anyone else.

06:21.600 --> 06:22.250
But Master Zhang,

06:23.750 --> 06:27.020
the Huo Clan is a bandwagoner.

06:28.160 --> 06:30.100
They have been working with Ding Qiansui closely lately.

06:30.510 --> 06:31.850
They are waiting to see

06:32.160 --> 06:34.140
who will win in the end.

06:34.560 --> 06:36.290
The Mystic Nine, or Ding Qiansui.

06:37.510 --> 06:38.700
Now that Xiangu has done me a favor,

06:39.510 --> 06:41.220
she'll have a hard time answering to her clan.

06:42.000 --> 06:44.140
While her clan is working with Ding Qiansui,

06:45.510 --> 06:47.580
Xiangu herself still sides with the Mystic Nine.

06:48.310 --> 06:50.290
She helped you because she cares.

06:52.870 --> 06:54.250
The weather is great today.

06:55.070 --> 06:56.490
Indeed.

06:56.800 --> 06:57.410
Sing.

07:00.190 --> 07:00.850
Master Zhang.

07:01.190 --> 07:02.660
I only know two lines.

07:05.560 --> 07:07.410
Sure, I'll continue.

07:10.160 --> 07:16.100
♪Administer the medicine and help the sick♪

07:19.260 --> 07:22.500
[Huo's Residence]

07:39.480 --> 07:40.050
Xiaomei!

07:42.120 --> 07:42.730
Xiaomei!

07:43.310 --> 07:44.170
Put her down at once.

07:44.480 --> 07:45.340
Why did you do that?

07:45.600 --> 07:46.460
Because of you.

07:57.070 --> 07:57.730
Why?

07:58.120 --> 08:01.370
You told Zhang Qishan

08:01.510 --> 08:02.780
Qi Tiezui's whereabouts.

08:04.390 --> 08:05.780
She was punished on your behalf.

08:06.360 --> 08:07.220
You don't know?

08:08.070 --> 08:10.980
You have achieved what you wanted to achieve.

08:11.950 --> 08:13.340
Isn't this

08:13.680 --> 08:15.220
the outcome you seek?

08:15.390 --> 08:16.490
Xiaomei knows nothing.

08:17.070 --> 08:18.410
I merely gave her the order.

08:18.680 --> 08:19.780
Just put her down.

08:20.240 --> 08:21.490
At this point,

08:21.800 --> 08:23.730
you should just worry about yourself.

08:24.240 --> 08:25.410
No harming each other within the Mystic Nine.

08:25.920 --> 08:27.460
I was just doing my job.

08:28.000 --> 08:28.610
Foolish.

08:30.120 --> 08:31.540
We nominated you as the head of the clan

08:31.950 --> 08:33.820
because you are smart.

08:34.440 --> 08:35.420
Do you really think

08:35.440 --> 08:37.370
that you have the power to order us around?

08:46.670 --> 08:47.220
Nian.

08:48.600 --> 08:49.820
I once told you

08:50.840 --> 08:52.820
that as long as you did Ding Qiansui's bidding,

08:53.080 --> 08:55.490
anyone you cared about could become successful.

08:55.910 --> 08:57.460
But you defied us.

08:58.630 --> 08:59.730
This outcome

09:01.030 --> 09:02.770
is the consequence of your action.

09:03.600 --> 09:04.420
Do you know?

09:06.480 --> 09:07.770
Ding Qiansui is already dead.

09:07.960 --> 09:09.700
We have repaid our debt to him.

09:09.870 --> 09:11.700
His life or death has nothing to do with us anymore.

09:12.030 --> 09:13.420
Can't you see the bigger picture?

09:13.870 --> 09:14.770
We are pawns.

09:14.770 --> 09:15.580
We have a place to be.

09:16.440 --> 09:18.160
Ding Qiansui became this powerful

09:18.160 --> 09:19.940
because his mastermind wanted to use him

09:20.000 --> 09:21.650
to eliminate the Mystic Nine.

09:22.360 --> 09:23.340
Now that he's gone,

09:24.120 --> 09:27.180
the mastermind wants to use us.

09:27.720 --> 09:29.250
If we do their bidding,

09:29.750 --> 09:32.340
we can easily become the head of Mystic Nine.

09:32.630 --> 09:34.250
Ding Qiansui worked for the Japanese.

09:34.510 --> 09:36.370
Are you planning to work with the Japanese?

09:39.240 --> 09:39.890
I see it now.

09:41.550 --> 09:42.130
Have you

09:42.150 --> 09:43.610
already worked with the Japanese?

09:45.360 --> 09:47.100
Don't you know

09:47.200 --> 09:48.820
that they want to take over our nation?

09:49.000 --> 09:50.610
And why does it matter to us?

09:51.080 --> 09:52.820
Be it the Japanese or the Mystic Nine,

09:53.200 --> 09:55.220
whoever can preserve our clan legacy

09:55.720 --> 09:57.340
will be our friends.

09:58.240 --> 09:59.730
Our legacy cannot fall.

10:00.910 --> 10:01.650
Otherwise,

10:02.910 --> 10:04.700
women like us

10:05.720 --> 10:07.460
will suffer a horrible fate.

10:08.480 --> 10:10.460
Surely, you are aware of that.

10:14.840 --> 10:15.530
Girls!

10:23.750 --> 10:24.980
This is your confession letter.

10:24.980 --> 10:25.740
[Confession Letter]

10:26.550 --> 10:27.340
Sign it

10:28.670 --> 10:29.650
and receive your punishment.

10:30.150 --> 10:30.850
I don't care.

10:31.670 --> 10:32.890
We cannot work with the Japanese.

10:33.240 --> 10:34.580
How delusional.

10:36.480 --> 10:37.700
The moment we decided

10:37.790 --> 10:39.820
to work with Ding Qiansui,

10:40.200 --> 10:41.250
we already knew

10:42.630 --> 10:44.220
there was no turning back.

10:46.720 --> 10:47.610
Just sign it.

10:49.840 --> 10:50.460
Madam.

10:53.150 --> 10:53.730
Please.

10:56.510 --> 10:57.490
Touch me if you dare.

11:01.550 --> 11:03.340
You're asking for it.

11:04.600 --> 11:05.340
Hit her!

11:06.440 --> 11:06.980
Xiaomei.

11:07.870 --> 11:08.420
Xiaomei!

11:27.790 --> 11:28.940
Impossible.

11:29.440 --> 11:30.890
If Hatoyama could do that,

11:31.360 --> 11:32.890
why didn't he kill all of us already?

11:34.030 --> 11:35.730
If he could kill across time and space,

11:36.960 --> 11:38.490
I would be dead first.

11:39.440 --> 11:40.940
But he chose to kill Ding Qiansui.

11:41.870 --> 11:43.300
This doesn't make sense,

11:44.000 --> 11:44.980
but they said

11:45.480 --> 11:46.580
it wasn't a spell.

11:49.910 --> 11:52.610
Ding Qiansui said that Yoshiyuki Hatoyama had been to Xiangxi.

11:53.030 --> 11:53.530
Master.

11:59.630 --> 12:00.610
We have news from Third Master.

12:01.000 --> 12:01.850
The underground river

12:02.030 --> 12:03.010
follows this route.

12:03.200 --> 12:04.060
It leads to Xiangxi.

12:04.480 --> 12:05.180
But it branches out

12:05.390 --> 12:06.820
too much in Xiangxi. It's hard to judge where they went.

12:07.720 --> 12:08.980
The discovery of the Otherworld Tower

12:09.150 --> 12:10.890
is enough to earn him merits in Japan,

12:11.000 --> 12:11.940
but he's still not content.

12:13.960 --> 12:14.420
Master Zhang,

12:14.790 --> 12:16.730
perhaps Xiangxi hides a bigger secret?

12:18.240 --> 12:18.730
Eighth Master.

12:22.360 --> 12:23.460
Ding Qiansui said that this was the secret

12:23.670 --> 12:24.180
behind

12:24.550 --> 12:26.010
Hatoyama's spells.

12:26.960 --> 12:27.730
Have you seen this before?

12:28.390 --> 12:29.700
See what?

12:30.000 --> 12:30.940
It's so ugly.

12:31.200 --> 12:31.610
Master Zhang.

12:31.840 --> 12:33.300
What nonsense is this?

12:33.560 --> 12:34.490
Urgh.

12:34.630 --> 12:36.200
It's a golden pot.

12:36.720 --> 12:38.300
It rotates when used.

12:39.030 --> 12:40.010
Let's go now.

12:40.390 --> 12:41.180
Ninth Master

12:41.790 --> 12:43.330
will handle the origin of the pot.

12:43.390 --> 12:44.530
But Xiangxi is huge.

12:45.030 --> 12:46.180
How are we supposed to find them?

12:46.600 --> 12:47.980
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama probably went to Xiangxi

12:48.150 --> 12:48.850
to find

12:48.870 --> 12:50.530
the cave in which the Otherworld Patriarch received enlightenment.

12:51.840 --> 12:52.300
Master Zhang,

12:53.240 --> 12:53.940
if we can solicit

12:53.960 --> 12:55.220
the support from 82 Stockade,

12:55.390 --> 12:56.490
we will definitely find the one

12:56.550 --> 12:58.100
who saw the Otherworld Patriarch back then

12:58.390 --> 12:59.940
and the location of the cave.

13:01.150 --> 13:02.130
We'll depart immediately

13:02.600 --> 13:03.250
to Xiangxi.

13:04.000 --> 13:05.130
We already have troops stationed over there.

13:05.480 --> 13:06.770
Tell them to contact 82 Stockade

13:07.200 --> 13:08.010
and explain why we're there.

13:08.510 --> 13:09.010
Noted.

13:09.670 --> 13:10.420
But what should we say

13:10.600 --> 13:12.180
if the Ministry of War inquires about our movement?

13:12.870 --> 13:13.460
If we leave now,

13:13.840 --> 13:14.530
Huo Wenhai can take over

13:14.550 --> 13:15.530
Changsha.

13:16.870 --> 13:17.580
Tell everyone

13:18.000 --> 13:18.580
that Zhang Qishan

13:18.910 --> 13:20.060
went to 82 Stockade to borrow soldiers

13:20.360 --> 13:21.100
for Changsha's defense

13:21.510 --> 13:22.580
and future battles.

13:23.150 --> 13:23.850
It's a secret operation

13:24.080 --> 13:24.730
and it won't be reported.

13:24.840 --> 13:25.250
Yes.

13:28.910 --> 13:29.650
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

13:29.670 --> 13:31.250
is a renowned scientist in Japan.

13:32.000 --> 13:33.490
He planned carefully

13:33.960 --> 13:34.460
to take

13:35.200 --> 13:36.850
Laogou away from Changsha.

13:37.790 --> 13:39.530
It seems like Laogou plays an important role

13:40.030 --> 13:41.460
in the Japanese plan.

13:43.080 --> 13:44.940
Fifth Master is a hooligan.

13:45.480 --> 13:46.820
I don't see why the Japanese

13:46.870 --> 13:47.610
think

13:47.630 --> 13:48.940
he is so valuable.

13:51.270 --> 13:51.980
Save Laogou.

13:52.720 --> 13:53.300
Will you come or not?

13:53.840 --> 13:54.340
Yes.

13:55.270 --> 13:56.530
I have to be there.

13:59.630 --> 14:01.130
Xiangu saved me.

14:57.440 --> 14:58.010
Don't move.

15:01.360 --> 15:01.980
Don't move!

15:26.750 --> 15:27.300
Come out.

15:40.030 --> 15:40.580
Mr. Wu,

15:41.840 --> 15:43.220
speed up the progress now.

15:44.000 --> 15:45.890
Zhang Qishan is trying his best to rescue you,

15:47.960 --> 15:49.300
but it'll take him some time

15:50.030 --> 15:51.770
to find this place.

15:55.910 --> 15:57.770
Do you really expect him to save you?

15:58.960 --> 16:00.850
So your falling out with him

16:01.480 --> 16:02.730
was just a rumor then.

16:06.200 --> 16:06.730
Guards.

16:10.790 --> 16:11.530
Can you guess who they are?

16:12.390 --> 16:14.460
Show us what you can do

16:15.000 --> 16:18.250
or they will become its meal.

16:20.600 --> 16:21.580
I was wondering

16:22.200 --> 16:24.180
what a smart Japanese person like you

16:24.720 --> 16:25.890
would do to torture me.

16:26.910 --> 16:27.580
Disappointingly,

16:29.120 --> 16:31.220
it's still the same old dirty trick.

16:31.870 --> 16:35.130
Yes, the same old dirty trick

16:35.750 --> 16:39.610
which works so well against the Chinese.

16:41.270 --> 16:43.220
People wouldn't be suffering if Zhang Qishan

16:44.270 --> 16:46.220
actually cared to save everyone.

17:30.030 --> 17:30.570
Stop.

17:36.830 --> 17:37.730
I'll tame it.

17:38.070 --> 17:38.660
How long do you need?

17:38.880 --> 17:39.460
Seven days.

17:39.720 --> 17:40.290
Five days.

17:40.400 --> 17:41.380
It takes time to tame it!

17:41.590 --> 17:42.660
You have five days.

17:52.000 --> 17:52.770
Fine. Five days.

17:53.160 --> 17:54.010
Let them out now.

17:54.160 --> 17:55.290
Now!

18:11.070 --> 18:12.010
After five days,

18:12.350 --> 18:14.460
I want to see the result.

18:16.510 --> 18:17.140
Wait.

18:22.510 --> 18:23.980
Then, I have to use my secret weapon.

18:26.070 --> 18:28.770
Whatever you have in there is useless.

18:29.110 --> 18:30.010
What do you need?

18:30.750 --> 18:31.810
Taming a dog

18:32.640 --> 18:33.980
is all about one thing.

18:35.270 --> 18:37.180
Find their favourite food.

18:37.640 --> 18:38.530
Even a wolf

18:39.070 --> 18:40.460
will wag its tail when it smells

18:41.160 --> 18:42.490
its favourite food.

18:43.310 --> 18:43.770
Therefore,

18:44.720 --> 18:46.330
find out what this beast

18:46.480 --> 18:47.700
loves to eat.

18:47.880 --> 18:48.570
What kind of food?

18:49.790 --> 18:50.620
How would I know?

18:52.310 --> 18:53.010
So,

18:53.790 --> 18:56.290
go to the place where you captured it.

18:56.830 --> 18:58.290
There might be a lot of leads there.

18:59.310 --> 19:01.050
For example, hair, paw prints,

19:01.440 --> 19:02.700
or even leftover bones.

19:03.510 --> 19:04.730
Those will help me understand its instinct.

19:07.510 --> 19:08.330
To tame it,

19:09.240 --> 19:11.050
you start with its instinct.

19:14.070 --> 19:15.570
Mr. Wu, you're trying to escape.

19:18.000 --> 19:19.220
You think I can escape?

19:21.960 --> 19:22.770
Bring him with us.

19:23.310 --> 19:23.730
Yes!

19:24.790 --> 19:25.460
What else do you need?

19:26.720 --> 19:27.570
I need a whistle.

19:28.310 --> 19:29.290
Give me a paper and a pen.

19:30.240 --> 19:31.530
Give him what he wants.

19:40.740 --> 19:43.940
[Otherworld Patriarch]

19:51.640 --> 19:52.490
My child,

19:53.480 --> 19:55.220
you are stubborn.

19:58.680 --> 19:59.490
Come.

20:01.240 --> 20:03.770
Let me show you your previous life.

20:16.310 --> 20:17.220
I'll say it one more time.

20:17.220 --> 20:17.880
[Silky Masterpiece]

20:17.880 --> 20:19.490
I'm not part of the Wang Clan anymore.

20:20.030 --> 20:22.660
I decide who I want to marry.

20:23.070 --> 20:25.050
I joined this embroidery workshop because I wanted

20:25.240 --> 20:26.330
nothing to do with hooligans like you.

20:26.750 --> 20:28.050
Are you pushing your luck?

20:29.350 --> 20:30.140
What are you doing?

20:30.140 --> 20:30.860
- Hey! - Don't come near us.

20:31.200 --> 20:32.290
You're in public now.

20:32.510 --> 20:34.290
You can't hit us.

20:34.480 --> 20:35.490
What is the meaning of this?

20:35.640 --> 20:38.010
Is this how your clan does this?

20:38.590 --> 20:39.770
Whoever marries you

20:39.880 --> 20:41.530
will be miserable forever.

20:41.750 --> 20:42.860
This is none of your business.

20:43.030 --> 20:43.700
Move aside.

20:44.070 --> 20:44.570
Hey!

20:44.590 --> 20:45.290
- Madam! - Let me teach you a lesson.

20:45.310 --> 20:46.140
[Lin Lanqing]
- Hey! - Stop.

20:47.110 --> 20:47.620
Madam.

20:49.200 --> 20:49.900
The Madam is here.

20:49.920 --> 20:51.730
Madam, help me out.

20:57.680 --> 20:58.460
Blacksmith Wang.

20:59.000 --> 21:01.010
Instead of minding your business,

21:01.550 --> 21:03.490
you came to bully the women of this workshop?

21:03.920 --> 21:04.570
Lin Lanqing.

21:05.440 --> 21:07.940
You're just a stupid spinster.

21:08.720 --> 21:10.860
And now, you're housing a bunch of sleazy women

21:11.110 --> 21:12.180
in your stupid embroidery workshop.

21:12.350 --> 21:13.960
The whole Jiangning looks filthy

21:14.070 --> 21:15.050
because of you.

21:16.920 --> 21:17.770
Stupid embroidery workshop?

21:19.920 --> 21:21.380
[Jiangning Women's Embroidery Workshop]
This plaque was given personally

21:21.440 --> 21:22.980
by the Imperial Household Department.

21:23.720 --> 21:26.460
Other than the Jiangning Weaving Bureau, no one has it.

21:26.460 --> 21:27.380
[Jiangning Women's Embroidery Workshop]

21:27.830 --> 21:29.420
I don't even have to report you

21:29.640 --> 21:30.860
to the magistrate's office.

21:31.270 --> 21:33.010
I can just report you to the Imperial Household Department.

21:33.880 --> 21:35.140
Can you bear the consequences?

21:37.720 --> 21:39.530
Madam, you are amazing.

21:39.880 --> 21:41.380
When we go out,

21:41.640 --> 21:43.530
everyone in Jiangning looks at us with respect.

21:43.550 --> 21:45.530
That's right. That will show them what will happen to those

21:45.920 --> 21:47.530
who cross us.

21:47.750 --> 21:48.660
Yes.

21:49.920 --> 21:50.490
Xiaoshu.

21:51.310 --> 21:52.290
Today is an exception.

21:53.000 --> 21:53.660
From now on,

21:54.790 --> 21:56.220
do not quarrel with them.

21:57.480 --> 21:59.940
I didn't do it. They started...

22:02.110 --> 22:02.900
Lanqing.

22:08.750 --> 22:09.570
Mr. Magistrate.

22:10.200 --> 22:10.770
At ease.

22:13.960 --> 22:14.900
You're dismissed.

22:15.640 --> 22:16.570
Mr. Magistrate.

22:16.750 --> 22:18.490
How can I help you?

22:18.830 --> 22:20.730
The higher-up

22:21.110 --> 22:22.940
placed an emergency order.

22:28.640 --> 22:30.090
500 bolts per month,

22:31.510 --> 22:32.570
for a total amount of 3,000 bolts.

22:33.000 --> 22:33.420
I...

22:34.590 --> 22:36.810
That's nearly 30% of the Weaving Bureau's annual output.

22:39.400 --> 22:41.490
You're not the only one who received the order.

22:42.240 --> 22:43.900
From Hangzhou all the way to Suzhou,

22:44.440 --> 22:47.380
every workshop has to produce hundreds of bolts now.

22:47.640 --> 22:48.380
Mr. Magistrate,

22:49.000 --> 22:51.570
our workshop only has around 100 people, and we sew by hand.

22:52.030 --> 22:54.140
We won't reach this number even if we sew till we die.

22:54.750 --> 22:56.050
The higher you are, the greater you fall.

22:56.720 --> 22:58.330
Are you trying to defy the imperial decree?

22:59.640 --> 23:00.530
You'll lose your reputation,

23:00.790 --> 23:01.810
your plaque,

23:02.200 --> 23:03.860
and even your family members.

23:23.440 --> 23:24.620
What are you doing?

23:24.790 --> 23:25.980
What are you doing?

23:26.000 --> 23:26.660
Am I getting killed?

23:27.320 --> 23:28.220
Be nice.

23:28.350 --> 23:29.420
Let go of me!

23:31.270 --> 23:32.250
Let go!

23:36.750 --> 23:38.940
Madam, we didn't mean to run away.

23:39.110 --> 23:39.940
That's right, Madam.

23:41.200 --> 23:42.290
Our fingers are cut.

23:43.070 --> 23:44.290
Our eyes are blurry.

23:45.030 --> 23:47.380
We are just a burden to the workshop.

23:48.270 --> 23:50.330
Please spare us.

23:50.880 --> 23:52.050
If all of you run away,

23:53.880 --> 23:54.620
the rest

23:55.960 --> 23:56.860
will die.

23:57.400 --> 23:58.860
But if we continue working like this,

23:59.070 --> 24:01.330
we'll die from exhaustion too, Madam.

24:02.790 --> 24:04.920
Please spare us.

24:04.950 --> 24:06.770
- Madam. - Madam.

24:06.790 --> 24:08.010
- Madam. - Madam.

24:08.030 --> 24:09.160
Mercy.

24:09.160 --> 24:09.810
Madam.

24:10.160 --> 24:11.410
Madam.

24:11.930 --> 24:12.730
Madam.

24:13.070 --> 24:14.940
I beg you, Madam.

24:16.160 --> 24:16.770
Take them away.

24:17.640 --> 24:19.530
Don't do this, Madam.

24:19.550 --> 24:21.220
- Madam. - Madam.

24:21.240 --> 24:22.250
- Madam. - Madam.

24:22.270 --> 24:24.070
Madam!

24:24.720 --> 24:26.490
Don't do this.

24:31.550 --> 24:32.180
Madam.

24:32.720 --> 24:35.810
You said women in this workshop should not hurt each other.

24:36.790 --> 24:38.090
Why did you break the promise?

24:48.960 --> 24:49.860
I

24:52.160 --> 24:53.140
had no choice.

25:01.160 --> 25:02.460
You earned this plaque

25:03.590 --> 25:06.330
with your needle and thread.

25:07.350 --> 25:08.660
In the past, we enjoyed the glory and the fame.

25:09.960 --> 25:12.940
You said it'd protect us.

25:16.200 --> 25:19.140
But I don't see any protection now,

25:20.000 --> 25:21.330
only suffering.

25:28.240 --> 25:29.460
Women like us

25:30.310 --> 25:31.980
fight an uphill battle

25:33.720 --> 25:35.620
to survive in this world.

25:37.680 --> 25:40.180
In this workshop, we can feel safe.

25:41.720 --> 25:42.700
We won't be bullied.

25:46.310 --> 25:48.380
And we owe it to our needlework.

25:50.720 --> 25:51.770
If the workshop falls,

25:53.160 --> 25:54.090
and the plaque is gone,

25:57.070 --> 25:58.010
we will be forced

25:58.310 --> 26:00.290
to marry men

26:01.720 --> 26:03.050
or sold as slaves.

26:04.640 --> 26:05.940
What we can do now

26:07.440 --> 26:09.140
is to embroider obediently

26:10.240 --> 26:11.530
to keep our workshop alive.

26:14.000 --> 26:15.290
There is no other way.

26:19.950 --> 26:21.200
To be enslaved by others

26:22.110 --> 26:23.420
or to be enslaved here,

26:24.920 --> 26:25.980
what difference does it make?

27:06.780 --> 27:09.940
[Huo Clan Salt Mine]

27:23.550 --> 27:24.180
Xiaomei.

27:36.640 --> 27:37.290
Xiaomei.

27:41.510 --> 27:42.330
Miss Huo.

27:50.720 --> 27:51.460
Miss Huo.

27:52.550 --> 27:55.980
Have I carried out the task you gave me?

27:59.270 --> 28:00.530
Yes, you did so well.

28:07.110 --> 28:07.770
Don't worry.

28:09.160 --> 28:10.530
I'll bring you out.

28:13.310 --> 28:14.010
You're awake?

28:18.350 --> 28:19.250
Is this the salt mine?

28:21.110 --> 28:22.050
You can't tell?

28:23.070 --> 28:24.050
Huo Clan salt mine.

28:27.200 --> 28:29.810
If you're awake, start working now.

28:35.200 --> 28:36.380
She's seriously injured.

28:37.000 --> 28:38.770
Can you find a doctor to treat her?

28:39.200 --> 28:40.050
Are you bossing me around?

28:41.480 --> 28:43.290
Do you think you're still the head of the clan?

28:44.240 --> 28:45.220
You want a doctor?

28:45.550 --> 28:46.490
Listen.

28:46.920 --> 28:48.770
Your confession letter is still here in the mine.

28:49.640 --> 28:51.180
You have been disowned by the Huo Clan.

28:51.200 --> 28:52.770
You're as good as dead.

28:53.640 --> 28:55.900
This is your afterlife.

28:57.000 --> 28:59.980
From now on, you'll listen to us.

29:05.830 --> 29:06.770
Play nice.

29:20.400 --> 29:22.050
Don't move. Or I'll cut her.

30:00.200 --> 30:01.330
- Hurry up. - Be quick.

30:01.350 --> 30:01.620
Quick.

30:02.160 --> 30:03.220
- Work now. - Don't be lazy.

30:05.070 --> 30:05.700
Work fast.

30:08.110 --> 30:09.330
Let's go.

30:20.400 --> 30:21.140
Lock the gate.

30:22.270 --> 30:24.380
There are only black plague patients inside. She'll die soon.

31:02.000 --> 31:02.490
Xiaomei.

31:32.200 --> 31:32.810
Xiaomei.

31:34.790 --> 31:35.290
Xiaomei.

31:36.200 --> 31:36.730
Xiaomei.

31:37.440 --> 31:38.010
Xiaomei!

31:41.160 --> 31:41.730
Xiaomei.

35:04.930 --> 35:06.120
Look. It's so beautiful.

35:07.430 --> 35:08.400
So pretty.

35:15.360 --> 35:16.490
Xiaozhu obeys the dog whistle.

35:17.440 --> 35:18.860
It can command every dog in my clan.

35:22.550 --> 35:23.860
It will hide by your side every day,

35:24.800 --> 35:25.980
and will appear when you need it.

36:03.300 --> 36:05.500
[Memorial Tablet of Huo Clan's Great Matron]

36:05.500 --> 36:07.700
[Memorial Tablet of Huo Clan's Founding Matron]

36:12.230 --> 36:12.900
My sisters,

36:13.710 --> 36:15.940
we have to appoint a new head today.

36:16.800 --> 36:17.820
Take a good look.

36:19.030 --> 36:21.780
Pick an obedient girl.

36:58.960 --> 36:59.610
All of you, leave now.

37:09.510 --> 37:10.130
Xiaomei.

37:13.590 --> 37:14.690
I brought you back.

37:16.230 --> 37:17.460
How did you get out?

37:18.920 --> 37:19.570
Guards!

37:25.670 --> 37:26.460
Touch me if you dare.

37:32.190 --> 37:34.170
Everyone in the salt mine is dead.

37:39.110 --> 37:40.980
If you want to join them,

37:42.800 --> 37:44.210
feel free.

38:02.510 --> 38:04.380
And my three honorable aunts,

38:05.480 --> 38:06.740
any tricks you have left?

38:13.920 --> 38:15.260
I'm waiting.

38:21.190 --> 38:23.610
May I know what the important occasion is?

38:24.670 --> 38:26.130
I see the elders of the Huo Sisters Guild

38:26.840 --> 38:28.780
have gathered here with everyone else.

38:30.480 --> 38:31.050
Today,

38:32.800 --> 38:34.780
we will appoint a new head of the clan

38:35.760 --> 38:37.420
because the previous head

38:38.920 --> 38:39.860
is dead.

38:42.590 --> 38:44.050
Is this a joke, my aunt?

38:46.670 --> 38:48.050
Aren't I alive?

38:48.880 --> 38:50.260
When I say you're dead,

38:51.960 --> 38:53.460
you are dead.

38:55.670 --> 38:56.380
Bring them out.

39:06.320 --> 39:07.130
They are

39:07.150 --> 39:08.940
your loyal sisters.

39:11.760 --> 39:13.260
They have been helping you.

39:14.400 --> 39:15.900
They even got on their knees to beg me

39:16.760 --> 39:18.010
when I sent you to the salt mine.

39:18.760 --> 39:19.900
They asked me to spare you.

39:20.920 --> 39:21.940
Surely, you don't want

39:21.960 --> 39:23.260
to see them dead here.

39:24.190 --> 39:26.170
And where is your mother's memorial tablet?

39:28.840 --> 39:30.050
Don't you want to find out?

39:31.590 --> 39:33.740
So you have been plotting against me

39:34.880 --> 39:36.170
the moment I became the head of the clan.

39:40.840 --> 39:42.130
The kindness you showed when I was little

39:44.360 --> 39:45.570
was all fake.

39:54.030 --> 39:55.740
Our ancestral teaching is right.

39:58.630 --> 39:59.940
Never trust anyone.

40:01.280 --> 40:02.610
Never fall in love.

40:03.800 --> 40:04.490
Nian,

40:07.880 --> 40:08.780
you have finally

40:10.400 --> 40:11.530
understood this.

40:12.630 --> 40:14.420
But you have to make a choice now.

40:16.880 --> 40:18.610
Save them

40:19.880 --> 40:20.980
or save yourself.

40:33.840 --> 40:36.610
What fictitious crime do you want me to carry this time?

40:37.880 --> 40:38.610
Anything.

40:40.920 --> 40:43.010
Maybe you're brokenhearted because your lover, Wu Laogou,

40:43.590 --> 40:44.900
is dead,

40:45.920 --> 40:47.260
so you want to follow his footsteps.

40:59.190 --> 40:59.900
Nian.

41:02.710 --> 41:03.490
Drink it.

41:05.480 --> 41:06.260
Drink it.

41:07.030 --> 41:09.820
Your mother's memorial tablet will be kept safely,

41:10.510 --> 41:12.130
and your loyal sisters can live.

41:16.230 --> 41:17.010
No!

41:17.960 --> 41:18.780
No!

41:19.360 --> 41:20.300
No!

41:21.460 --> 41:22.300
No!

41:26.150 --> 41:27.090
Time is running out.

41:28.190 --> 41:29.380
We are old now.

41:30.510 --> 41:33.490
Make your decision now.

41:59.000 --> 42:03.570
- No! - No!

43:01.030 --> 43:03.210
Xiangu, I love you the most here.

43:21.630 --> 43:23.860
Two days ago, I saw them burning letters in the backyard.

43:26.710 --> 43:28.260
One of them concerns your mother.

43:28.680 --> 43:29.910
[Yuhua has fallen in Northwest China]
And I hid it.

43:30.190 --> 43:31.570
Then, they captured us.

43:32.880 --> 43:33.650
From now on,

43:34.360 --> 43:35.900
you are the head of the clan.

43:36.590 --> 43:38.740
Following our ancestral rules,

43:39.710 --> 43:42.490
your mother has to leave the clan.

43:44.550 --> 43:45.610
For you, your mother

43:46.280 --> 43:47.900
went to Northwestern China alone.

43:48.670 --> 43:51.530
It's a harsh place with no means of communication.

43:53.150 --> 43:54.420
So, she told me to tell you

43:55.000 --> 43:56.050
that from now on,

43:56.880 --> 43:59.260
prioritize our clan legacy over your own life.

43:59.590 --> 44:00.940
Manage our clan well.

44:07.960 --> 44:08.530
Nian.

44:13.400 --> 44:14.010
Aunt.

44:15.510 --> 44:16.420
My mother is...

44:17.800 --> 44:18.530
Your mother

44:19.920 --> 44:20.860
was killed

44:21.480 --> 44:22.840
[Memorial Tablet of Huo Yuhua]
by the vagrants in Northwestern China.

44:24.400 --> 44:25.260
So you asked

44:27.590 --> 44:30.170
Ding Qiansui to kill my mother.

44:31.320 --> 44:32.720
- No. - That's not true.

44:32.760 --> 44:34.340
I've always been the kindest to you.

44:34.400 --> 44:35.040
It was her.

44:35.590 --> 44:36.420
It was her.

44:36.880 --> 44:38.460
It was her. It has nothing to do with me.

44:38.510 --> 44:39.460
She did it.

44:39.480 --> 44:40.520
We didn't do it.

44:40.590 --> 44:41.740
It wasn't us.

45:00.710 --> 45:01.490
First Aunt.

45:03.150 --> 45:04.300
From now on,

45:06.280 --> 45:07.420
I'll take over the Huo Clan.

45:09.230 --> 45:10.920
I'll remove our old scars

45:10.920 --> 45:12.820
one by one.

45:13.710 --> 45:14.900
I'll find another way

45:15.670 --> 45:16.570
to keep this clan alive.

45:29.510 --> 45:31.210
But this future

45:34.360 --> 45:35.530
is not for you to see.

45:53.620 --> 45:57.780
♪The past fades like smoke♪

45:58.140 --> 46:00.860
♪A choice is made in silence♪

46:01.140 --> 46:03.940
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

46:04.340 --> 46:08.100
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

46:08.340 --> 46:11.780
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

46:12.060 --> 46:15.460
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

46:15.540 --> 46:22.820
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

46:23.260 --> 46:26.540
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

46:26.820 --> 46:30.060
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

46:30.220 --> 46:34.260
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

46:34.460 --> 46:37.820
♪Who believes in fate?♪

46:38.060 --> 46:41.420
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

46:41.660 --> 46:44.940
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

46:45.260 --> 46:48.940
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

46:49.140 --> 46:52.380
♪Take care♪

46:52.380 --> 46:54.940
♪We once raced♪

46:55.020 --> 46:56.940
♪For the dawn♪

46:57.100 --> 47:00.380
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

47:00.500 --> 47:03.780
♪In the web of fate♪

47:03.780 --> 47:06.980
♪No one can escape♪

47:07.980 --> 47:09.820
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

47:09.980 --> 47:11.540
♪We too were young once♪

47:11.620 --> 47:15.060
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

47:15.260 --> 47:17.580
♪Keep the ember lit♪

47:17.700 --> 47:22.220
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

47:22.340 --> 47:25.300
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

47:25.540 --> 47:29.060
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

47:29.180 --> 47:32.940
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

47:33.260 --> 47:36.740
♪Who believes in fate?♪

47:36.900 --> 47:39.900
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

47:40.140 --> 47:43.900
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

47:44.060 --> 47:47.780
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

47:47.900 --> 47:59.340
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
